  "updated_at": "2026-04-01",
  "bio": "Punky Von B is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Rouen, France, known for their expertise in dotwork, floral, and geometric styles. They own ICÔNE BODY ART, where they blend art nouveau, floral, and ornamental designs to create unique and intricate body art pieces. As a Maître Reiki practitioner, Punky infuses a sense of tranquility and mindfulness into the tattooing experience, ensuring clients leave with both a beautiful piece of art and a serene state of mind.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Rouen, Normandy, France"
}
